# Optional software, installed with one click from ES-DE (Mangmi Air X ->
# "Install - ...") or with "mangmi-update --add NAME". Kept out of the image to
# save space; ES-DE picks the emulators up as soon as they are installed.
# name|packages|description
armsx2|armsx2-bin|PlayStation 2 emulator ARMSX2 (very demanding on the Snapdragon 662)
duckstation|duckstation-bin|PlayStation emulator DuckStation (standalone, upscaling)
melonds|melonds-bin|Nintendo DS emulator melonDS (standalone)
ppsspp|ppsspp|PSP emulator PPSSPP (standalone)
dolphin|libretro-dolphin|GameCube / Wii core Dolphin (light games only)
firefox|firefox|Firefox web browser
scx|scx-scheds|sched_ext CPU schedulers (scx_lavd, scx_bpfland)
